  "description": "Solo Fight 7 is a robot-themed tower with a ladder up one side and two spiral tube slides winding down from the deck. Next to Solo Fight-5 it takes a little more ground, with a product area of 21'11\" x 10'4\". The spiral tubes give a longer, turning ride that children in the 5 to 12 key user group enjoy repeating. It is listed for ages 5+ with a capacity of 15. Colour choices are Play Red and Lavender Dilly, Knight Blue and Mango Yellow, or Play Orange and Forest Green. Allow a safe play area of 27'11\" x 14'4\". Manufacturing defects in the galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope are covered for 3 years. Ask for a layout to see how it sits on your plot.",
